    "falsification_condition": "The claim fails if either post-seal threshold Take atomic interval does not overlap every registered historical and later ground-dissociation interval for its isotopologue; if any of eight measurement rows, a state, product channel, condition, source or uncertainty is erased; if any measured number is readable before the relation seal; if a deliberately displaced interval is accepted; or if a fitted coefficient or correction is introduced.",
